This package reads the graph.json produced by graphify
(https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify), licensed under Apache-2.0.
No graphify source is redistributed here. The DEFAULT_RELATIONS constant in
src/graph.ts mirrors graphify's DEFAULT_AFFECTED_RELATIONS so that
`graphify affected` and these rules traverse the same edge kinds.

This package is a plugin for Probity (https://github.com/nizos/probity),
licensed under MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Nizar Selander. No Probity source is
redistributed here. The shell-redirect detection in src/changed.ts follows the
approach used by Probity's own forbidCommandPattern configuration.

The approach and the regression figures cited in README.md come from TDAD
(https://github.com/pepealonso95/TDAD), licensed under MIT,
Copyright (c) 2026 Rafael Alonso.
